Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.42,0:00:12.88,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I feel bad for the mice.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:12.88,0:00:16.99,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll stomp out the bad guys,\N while you all keep them from—
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.99,0:00:18.00,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.60,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.60,0:00:22.37,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Because the hole will collapse and none of them will survive.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,And that won't solve anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.19,0:00:24.89,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.24,0:00:28.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,We have to play by the rules to beat this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.77,0:00:31.39,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we won't get our reward.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.77,0:00:41.69,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Nozomi!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.74,0:00:51.54,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.92,0:00:53.67,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.40,0:00:57.30,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Is there actually any point in doing this?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.74,0:00:59.18,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.18,0:01:00.92,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,This one won't lead us anywhere either.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.26,0:01:03.41,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We won't know unless we try.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.87,0:01:26.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-I'm beat.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.05,0:01:27.50,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.50,0:01:28.74,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Here, drink this.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.49,0:01:33.37,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,He made it to a few of the worlds we were aiming for, didn't he?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.96,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,True, but it felt like that was only really by chance.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.96,0:01:40.13,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Like a luck-of-the-draw gacha machine?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.46,0:01:43.84,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,You'll hit the jackpot eventually, just keep on trying.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.99,0:01:48.75,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I somehow doubt it's going to be that simple.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.92,0:01:50.77,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.77,0:01:52.72,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Oh? What are you apologizing for?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.72,0:01:54.10,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,The more failures we have,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.12,0:01:56.29,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,the greater our chances of succeeding.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.29,0:01:59.11,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That's right. We have as many tomorrows here as we need.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.67,0:02:01.83,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.83,0:02:05.49,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee that this is going to go on forever, is there?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.07,0:02:08.41,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That may be true.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.41,0:02:10.99,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,And leaving this up to chance won't help us either.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:11.55,0:02:14.42,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,We've found a signpost to our original world,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.42,0:02:16.00,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,and a means of moving ourselves there.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.35,0:02:18.34,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,But what is it that connects the two?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.34,0:02:21.80,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Whether it's someone's power,\N or this world itself, we can't be sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:21.80,0:02:24.26,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,But finding another piece to the puzzle should help.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.66,0:02:28.29,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Handily, newly-discovered powers take on many different forms.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.29,0:02:30.89,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the light is closer, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.39,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Closer today than yesterday.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.61,0:02:35.27,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.72,0:02:38.12,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Let's set these mice free.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.67,0:02:43.64,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,It's not like all hope is lost in this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.36,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We'll save the revolutionary mouse,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.12,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,and shift the way things work in this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.49,0:02:50.49,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,A world where gold isn't everything—
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.14,0:02:53.75,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,there must be another level with a different paradigm.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.31,0:03:09.89,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Operation Mouse Relocation!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.17,0:03:25.75,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Have we beaten the world?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.75,0:03:28.28,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,You're getting better at using your power.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.28,0:03:32.22,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? You think so?\N It doesn't feel like anything has changed.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.22,0:03:34.54,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Nah, it's changed a bunch.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.54,0:03:37.73,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Seeing your improvement makes me think we can make it home soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.73,0:03:39.71,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Surely you're exaggerating.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.47,0:03:44.21,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Then again, remember what Ms. Aki said?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.93,0:03:47.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You know, how we'll never...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.33,0:03:49.72,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Don't pay her any mind.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:50.09,0:03:52.69,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,A doctor at the hospital once told me,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.69,0:03:56.85,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,"Never ever trust anything that comes out of a large-breasted woman's mouth."
Dialogue: 99,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.26,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,You see, all the nutrients go to her boobs—
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.26,0:04:01.78,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,A-All right, I get it!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:01.78,0:04:03.36,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Ah! You're blushing!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.17,0:04:12.77,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, could this be this world's reward?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.53,0:04:21.71,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.71,0:04:22.67,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,They came undone?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.96,0:04:24.13,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:31.36,0:04:34.93,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Didn't Ms. Aki seem way out of character?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.93,0:04:37.72,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's never spoken like that, has she?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:37.72,0:04:41.31,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,She had that hardcore cutie character going, didn't she?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.01,0:04:45.43,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Yeah, but, after suddenly showing up and saying what she did,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.39,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I don't think we can trust her.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:47.39,0:04:48.36,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.64,0:04:51.91,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,So what, are you saying that Ms. Aki is tricking us?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:51.91,0:04:53.87,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,For what reason?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.87,0:04:59.25,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,None of you can ever go back to your world again!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.58,0:05:01.75,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.75,0:05:04.13,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}No way. Why not?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.33,0:05:05.42,Alt Style,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}You came here to find us, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.13,0:05:07.25,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come on, I want to go home!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.42,0:05:08.42,Alt Style,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}I thought you were here to rescue us!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:07.25,0:05:08.42,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}We want to go home!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.42,0:05:10.72,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Shut up! Who do you think you're talking to?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.72,0:05:13.97,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,This was never about going home, was it?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.97,0:05:15.20,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.20,0:05:18.23,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,There are those among you who could use your powers before—
Dialogue: 99,0:05:18.23,0:05:22.10,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,that is, while you were still at school.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:24.96,0:05:26.11,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.11,0:05:30.49,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,that this whole "going adrift" thing might be the result of someone using their power!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.45,0:05:32.11,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.11,0:05:34.96,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,can we ask how {\i1}you{\i0} made your way here?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.96,0:05:38.20,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Huh, that's a great question from a terrible waste of oxygen.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:39.24,0:05:41.08,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,All right, listen up.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.57,0:05:45.33,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Because God needed me to, that's why!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.33,0:05:50.45,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Okay, but were there really those who could use their power at school?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:51.76,0:05:55.68,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,After hearing what Ms. Aki said,\N it kind of got me thinking.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.37,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,There were some strange incidents at school, remember?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:58.37,0:06:02.54,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Like three billion yen flying out of the lockers,\N and auroras appearing on the school grounds.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.54,0:06:08.49,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Thinking about it now, couldn't all of that have been the result of someone using their power?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.01,0:06:11.57,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,So you think Ms. Aki was telling the truth?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.26,0:06:16.19,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,But there's only one of us who could pull off something like that, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.49,0:06:21.66,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I hate to even bring this up, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.66,0:06:22.87,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.87,0:06:23.66,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.06,0:06:25.54,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,What? Out with it.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.20,0:06:30.80,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,He might just be pretending that he can't get back home to pull the wool over our eyes.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:30.80,0:06:32.78,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}I was kind of thinking that, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.18,0:06:32.78,Alt Style,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.19,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}You mean he's been lying to us?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.55,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is he for real?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.73,0:06:38.77,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Everyone be quiet! Settle down!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.77,0:06:41.18,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:41.18,0:06:44.44,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,I swear, I'm gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.44,0:06:47.08,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Now, now, take it easy.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.97,0:06:51.32,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's not possible for Nagara to be\N pretending that we can't go home.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.32,0:06:52.19,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,And why is that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:52.61,0:06:56.57,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,If he was trying to trick us all,\N then he never would have gone to other worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.57,0:07:00.45,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,That's right. Also, how can you suspect one of your classmates?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.45,0:07:05.33,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Doesn't that go against our school motto,\N "Live in harmony"?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.68,0:07:16.93,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.18,0:07:23.56,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You made this, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.21,0:07:25.75,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,For everybody?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.31,0:07:27.66,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Made what?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.66,0:07:30.56,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,I'm complimenting you. You're not happy?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.08,0:07:33.78,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm that big of a deal.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.78,0:07:34.97,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.97,0:07:35.94,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.69,0:07:39.71,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,'Cause there's heaps of talented people out there.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.71,0:07:41.24,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,And I don't just mean in this world—
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.24,0:07:43.09,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.09,0:07:46.66,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,It's thanks to this hole that the island has avoided sinking.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.41,0:07:49.54,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You're not like the others.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.87,0:07:52.06,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You're one of a kind.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.06,0:07:54.63,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,I don't believe that.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.63,0:07:56.34,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You poor boy.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.34,0:08:01.34,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Nobody really understands. Not even you.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.34,0:08:03.51,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Y-You're crushing me, Teacher.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:04.85,0:08:06.89,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You are somebody special.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.58,0:08:12.13,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You don't have to be bound by this world.\N The time is approaching.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:12.13,0:08:15.03,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You're going to evolve. It's something...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:15.03,0:08:17.53,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,that only you can do.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.16,0:08:29.54,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This is incredible.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.79,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It has the power to unravel things.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.15,0:08:35.06,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,This little guy is going to come in awfully handy.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.84,0:08:38.87,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Curious?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.97,0:08:43.68,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Those were supplied by other students who found power relics.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.05,0:08:45.57,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Power relics?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.57,0:08:48.95,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's kind of just what we started calling them.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.95,0:08:52.77,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,They're like the manifestation of a power that you receive
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.77,0:08:55.01,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,whenever you beat a world.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.01,0:08:58.44,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah? So the others already knew about these.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.93,0:09:00.73,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,So, that includes these?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.07,0:09:05.66,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Those are Go-Old Glasses.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.91,0:09:08.36,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,They allow you to see others as they'll look when they're old.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.35,0:09:13.21,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.71,0:09:15.21,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.13,0:09:19.21,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,{\an8}I never imagined that powers could come in so many shapes and size.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.73,0:09:23.14,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,The way home might even pop up unexpectedly.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.14,0:09:25.78,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Then you might be on before long.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.78,0:09:27.30,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.30,0:09:28.87,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yeah, our savior.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.87,0:09:30.48,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,C-Cut it out.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.85,0:09:34.48,Overlap,Mizuho,0,0,0,,{\an8}Japan's greatest balding, toothless, wrinkled old lump!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.48,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You know, Nagara...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.55,0:09:39.82,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Well, it's just... right now, all the others...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.45,0:09:43.82,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,kind of see you as the\N opposite of a savior, you might say.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.82,0:09:46.01,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,And, um, maybe even...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.53,0:09:49.95,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.95,0:09:52.24,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Is Nagara here?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.49,0:09:56.96,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,We'd like to have a word with you, if that's okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.21,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? With me?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.08,0:10:04.73,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Seriously? No, he's not doing it on purpose.\N Nagara wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.73,0:10:07.49,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Looking at the facts,\N it's only natural to think so, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.49,0:10:12.10,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Sure, he has his power, but it's wrong\N to jump to conclusions based only on that.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.37,0:10:16.05,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,That's why we asked him to come here.\N This is a discussion.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.05,0:10:18.89,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,We were hoping he could tell us all the truth.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.89,0:10:21.31,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Well, Nagara? Answer the question.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.93,0:10:23.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:23.73,0:10:26.61,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm not the one who did this.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.78,0:10:31.62,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Look, you may not realize...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.40,0:10:35.87,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,but we all have loved ones who we left behind.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.87,0:10:38.54,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Our parents will be worried sick waiting for us,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.54,0:10:40.96,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,and some of us were studying hard for entrance exams.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.96,0:10:42.13,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Same goes for those in clubs.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.40,0:10:45.76,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,We {\i1}have{\i0} to get back home.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.47,0:10:48.22,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm doing!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.53,0:10:52.10,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Unlike you, the rest of us are missed.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.28,0:10:54.90,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Say you're sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.41,0:10:57.15,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? What for?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:57.15,0:11:01.01,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Yeah, apologize for messing up everyone's lives!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.25,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-I'm sor—
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.25,0:11:03.61,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.44,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,We're talking to Nagara!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.44,0:11:07.36,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,This isn't a discussion.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.36,0:11:11.52,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,You just want to pin all of this on someone to make yourselves feel better!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:12.45,0:11:16.33,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We're all acting pretty ugly,\N and have been for some time.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.77,0:11:20.69,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I think we might have let\N Ms. Aki's words get to us too much.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.69,0:11:24.21,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We've come this far by working together, haven't we?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.59,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten that?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.97,0:11:29.99,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah, Hoshi's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.33,0:11:34.37,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you all going?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.37,0:11:38.48,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we're tired of his lectures.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.48,0:11:39.35,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.63,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,you're all willing to listen to Ms. Aki's lectures instead?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:42.63,0:11:47.86,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,For starters, she declared that we can never go back to our world, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.61,0:11:53.10,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,She then went on to invoke the name of God as to why she appeared in this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.10,0:11:54.62,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's strange?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.29,0:11:58.72,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You're not done with your compulsory education yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.72,0:12:01.13,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,I'll be the one who shows you the way!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.61,0:12:04.34,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,That isn't what you want, is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.34,0:12:07.13,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,There's no salvation in that.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.67,0:12:11.08,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,She isn't anyone's savior.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:15.14,0:12:18.77,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Your cheap tricks aren't going to save anyone either.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.51,0:12:21.77,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Still, it's the truth.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.06,0:12:47.96,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Do it right. You're not helping anyone like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.96,0:12:49.26,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't have the knack for it.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.26,0:12:51.38,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Knack's got nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.15,0:12:54.65,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Right, nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.65,0:12:58.97,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No matter where I go, or what power I have,\N it always ends up the same.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.03,0:13:03.41,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,My life has been like this ever since I was born.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.41,0:13:05.65,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,So you're just going to give up again.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:15.03,0:13:19.01,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Being born doesn't magically give your life meaning.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.10,0:13:25.42,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That's something you have to work out on your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.84,0:13:31.63,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Thinking that everything we're given in life already has its value or meaning set
Dialogue: 99,0:13:31.63,0:13:34.28,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,is like letting others decide for you, which is awful.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.09,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.09,0:13:38.10,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh, look!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.10,0:13:39.41,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Guardian spirits!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.56,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait, it's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.71,0:13:58.24,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Nagara, come on! It's incredible!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.01,0:14:01.25,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.67,0:14:05.57,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's safe! Come on, put your mask on!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.57,0:14:06.56,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.56,0:14:08.52,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hurry up, already!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.78,0:14:45.17,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Wasn't that amazing? I've never seen them before!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.17,0:14:47.17,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was awesome.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.17,0:14:49.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I didn't think the guardian spirits were minnows.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.79,0:14:52.05,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,For sure. That surprised me too.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.09,0:14:58.36,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.36,0:14:58.93,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.94,0:15:02.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Worth it?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.45,0:15:04.05,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.05,0:15:06.81,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Still, I'm impressed that you could just dive in like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.81,0:15:08.48,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,You're just too chicken.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.48,0:15:10.84,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,And you're not nearly cautious enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.60,0:15:13.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.46,0:15:16.56,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Do you ever get scared?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.56,0:15:19.20,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Sure I do. I get scared and anxious.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.74,0:15:23.70,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.32,0:15:26.30,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.80,0:15:41.35,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to us now?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.35,0:15:42.47,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.93,0:15:46.48,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,We're ready for this.\N We already know what's going to happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.82,0:15:57.04,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Running away again?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:57.57,0:15:58.46,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.46,0:15:59.49,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:59.76,0:16:03.89,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Your power is "Escape", the power to run away!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.89,0:16:06.19,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Your wanting to be somewhere else
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.19,0:16:08.25,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,has sucked everyone else into this world, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.75,0:16:10.92,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That isn't true.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.92,0:16:12.00,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.36,0:16:16.88,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Your power is just for running away—\Nthat means you can't go home, can you?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.49,0:16:22.24,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,All of you are going to be dragged along on his escape forever!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.24,0:16:24.00,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Wait! You're wrong. I—
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.64,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Shut up! She's not wrong!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.69,0:16:27.52,Default,Shanghai,0,0,0,,[Coward!]
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.89,0:16:35.90,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Knock it off, already. Quit making us suffer like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.09,0:16:38.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-It's not like that. Listen to me—
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.07,0:16:40.38,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,You're enjoying yourself right now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.38,0:16:41.17,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.17,0:16:43.91,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,You just happened to gain an incredible power,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.91,0:16:45.91,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,and now you've got girls being nice to you—
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.49,0:16:49.75,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,someone who was all but nonexistent back in our world.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.85,0:16:53.29,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't really care if I go back.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.80,0:16:56.43,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Whatever happens to you all, it doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.30,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Say that one more time.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.04,0:17:02.93,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.93,0:17:04.34,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Don't just apologize!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.27,0:17:09.70,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,You always act like this, and pretend to give up,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.70,0:17:12.56,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,when really, deep down, you're hoping for something!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.89,0:17:16.72,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,So would you stop dragging the rest of us down with you, already?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.82,0:17:22.32,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,You see? He ran off again.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.48,0:17:24.82,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Sorry to always be a bother.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.48,0:17:28.37,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You believe in God, Rajdhani?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.33,0:17:33.33,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Oh, not in God per se, but I do have my faith.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.39,0:17:37.34,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I heard him speak to me once.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.82,0:17:38.87,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.87,0:17:43.84,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,God. He told me that I was the one who caused us to go adrift.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:45.23,0:17:46.72,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What even is...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.27,0:17:48.57,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,my power, anyway?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.38,0:17:58.11,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.02,0:18:03.23,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh, good timing. Need some fish?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.97,0:18:14.04,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,No matter what they say about you,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:14.59,0:18:17.17,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,how I see you will never change.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.73,0:18:31.85,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-I really do want to go back home, too...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.85,0:18:34.32,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Even though it's...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.04,0:18:36.22,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stand up.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:39.71,0:18:41.15,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's still time.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.99,0:18:48.12,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Can we really not go home anymore?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.12,0:18:49.53,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.53,0:18:50.08,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.57,0:18:53.87,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,After going to different worlds from the school,\N we still made it back.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.87,0:18:57.81,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,{\i1}This{\i0} world and your own world are two completely different things.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.81,0:19:01.87,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,That girl, Nozomi, says that she can see the way out to our own world.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:01.87,0:19:03.56,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,She's lying.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.56,0:19:05.97,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Hurry up and accept the truth already.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:06.32,0:19:09.33,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Besides, there is still some hope for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.49,0:19:11.97,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,In him.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.29,0:19:14.73,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,The guardian who protects this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:27.61,0:19:29.26,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,O-Our savior!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:37.59,0:19:38.53,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.88,0:19:40.97,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Have you been crying?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:40.97,0:19:43.10,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.10,0:19:43.88,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.70,0:19:48.25,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,How did you get here?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.80,0:19:52.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You don't get to ask how,\N after suddenly vanishing on us.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.01,0:19:56.05,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,When we heard that you had disappeared,\N the three of us went looking for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.64,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,We went through a lot of trouble to get back here.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.64,0:20:01.16,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,If the student council president hadn't let us borrow this,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.16,0:20:03.15,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,we couldn't have made it.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.51,0:20:15.29,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Where's Nagara?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:15.68,0:20:17.04,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:19.61,0:20:20.92,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Why did you run?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.01,0:20:24.93,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Tell us why you ran away!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.93,0:20:29.47,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Well, there was no getting through to them with words. I had no choice.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.47,0:20:30.43,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You had no choice?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.17,0:20:34.93,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,If this is what it takes to satisfy them,\N then it's good enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.93,0:20:36.81,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Don't take us for idiots!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.81,0:20:42.06,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You sit there like you're the only one with a sob story,\N and scoff at everyone else around you!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.06,0:20:43.36,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Well, screw you!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.18,0:20:45.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.34,0:20:48.30,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Don't go running from the truth and fooling yourself!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:48.30,0:20:51.96,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,The moment you run,\N you become the same kind of idiot as the rest of them!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.96,0:20:53.65,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.65,0:20:56.70,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,This is what's so hopeless about you, Nagara.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.26,0:20:59.98,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:59.98,0:21:03.61,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You're not some cat.\N Don't go running off without warning.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.92,0:21:08.59,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Indeed. We're really glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.19,0:21:12.34,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.53,0:21:16.04,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,All right. No more running away.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.04,0:21:18.04,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Good. Let's go home.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.43,0:21:21.72,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Pff, so simpleminded.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.72,0:21:24.90,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You know, this looks familiar, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.90,0:21:27.11,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It reminds me a lot of the island we were first on.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.21,0:21:31.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,The island that burned? Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.43,0:21:33.49,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This is it, all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.10,0:21:37.46,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,No doubt about it. This is the island we were on.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.46,0:21:39.04,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,But that's strange.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.04,0:21:41.25,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That would mean there are two islands.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.11,0:21:48.75,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,So that's it. We may have been working under a huge misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.83,0:22:03.25,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Nagara's power had another meaning.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:03.25,0:22:07.97,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,We assumed that after the island burned,\N it was restored by Asakaze's power.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.97,0:22:09.28,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,But we were, in fact, wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:09.73,0:22:11.44,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It was Nagara's power.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.44,0:22:15.59,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? Nagara's power is teleporting, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.59,0:22:18.53,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Nagara's power is not a means of teleporting.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:19.05,0:22:21.58,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's the power to create new worlds!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.12,0:22:25.08,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,As is likely the case for every world we've ever gone to.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:32.70,0:22:34.83,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What an incredible view...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.26,0:22:38.05,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,The light is so close!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:38.05,0:22:38.14,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,{\iclip(m 686 932 l 870 930 b 863.5 942.5 848.5 959.5 827 973 798.5 974 739.5 976 710 979 l 694 1000)}The light is so close!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:38.14,0:22:38.22,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 1086 992 b 1099.25 986.25 1123.75 977.75 1145 979 1153.5 980.5 1176.5 990.5 1189 995)}The light is so close!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:38.22,0:22:38.30,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 1126 992 b 1141.75 986.5 1172.25 981.5 1193 983 1200.25 986.5 1214.75 995.5 1222 1000)}The light is so close!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:38.30,0:22:38.72,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 1168 993 b 1185 983.75 1212 985.25 1244 988 1249.75 991.5 1261.25 998.5 1267 1002)}The light is so close!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:46.05,0:22:47.98,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,That was an awful world.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:49.36,0:22:51.67,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,No one was nice to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:51.67,0:22:53.57,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Do you want to change the world?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:55.51,0:22:57.24,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Would you like to come with me?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:00.17,0:23:00.95,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Yeah.
